 * A setup that crashed between stashFreshInput and restoreFreshInput left
 * INPUT_STASH_DIR holding the ONLY copy of the fresh regenerated input/.
 * When the backup exists but input/ does not, move it back before anything
 * else can treat the leg as input-less (then the normal stash runs on it).
